  "description": "The Backroad FF stands for performance off the tarmac. Aerodynamics, comfort and catering were the top priorities during development – so that you can give your all in the race against yourself or others. Highlights of the Gravel-Race model platform • Gravel Race One-Piece Cockpit – built for speed • Plenty of tyre clearance – up to 45 mm tyre clearance • The 4iiii Precision 3+ power meter measures your performance • Well thought-out bag concept – magnetic, practical, beautiful The Backroad FF GRX/XT Di2 is also equipped with the new SHIMANO GRX Di2 groupset, combined with the SHIMANO Deore XT rear derailleur, Rose GC50 wheels and Maxxis Reaver tyres, as well as the Fizik Vento Argo R5 saddle paired with the Rose Aero D-Shape seat post. ¹ approx. 8.6 kg; may vary by up to +/- 5% due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for slate grey frame, size M, without pedals",
